      "name": "CopyDataToWindow",
      "signature": "void CopyDataToWindow(int pData)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Copies video buffer data to target window via WM_COPYDATA message.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Extract window handle from input structure (offset 0x470)\n  2. Get width (offset 0x10) and height (offset 0x14)\n  3. Calculate data size as width * height\n  4. Retrieve destination buffer pointer (offset 0x448)\n  5. Call _CopyData with handle, 0, 0xa500401, size, buffer\n\nParameters:\n  pData: Pointer to structure with:\n    - Offset 0x10: width (int)\n    - Offset 0x14: height (int)\n    - Offset 0x448: buffer pointer\n    - Offset 0x470: window handle (HWND)\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  No error checking or validation performed\n  Part of Smack video codec wrapper",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "API",
      "index": "API:00ae20ed802e3883313e20f96bfe2dda",
