      "name": "InitSmackBufferGlobals",
      "signature": "void InitSmackBufferGlobals(SmackBuffer * pBuffer)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Initialize global Smack buffer settings from structure\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Set buffer stride to 0x28 (40 decimal bytes per row)\n  2. Set palette pointer to NULL\n  3. Set format to 0x1 (16-bit color)\n  4. Set color depth to 0x8 (8 bits per pixel - paletted)\n  5. Extract buffer height from input structure at offset 0x14\n  6. Extract buffer memory address from input structure at offset 0x18\n\nParameters:\n  pBuffer - Pointer to SmackBuffer structure containing height (offset 0x14) and memory address (offset 0x18)\n\nReturns:\n  None (void)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Stride is always fixed at 0x28 (40 bytes), assumes 320x240 resolution\n  - Format (0x1) and depth (0x8) are hardcoded for 8-bit paletted mode\n  - Does not validate input structure pointer\n  - Does not initialize color palette (set to NULL)",
