      "name": "ProcessSmackAudioTracks",
      "signature": "void ProcessSmackAudioTracks(Smack * pSmack)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Processes audio track data for the current Smack video frame.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Check if frame playback is active (FrameNum != -1) and not paused (field 0x44c == 0)\n  2. Set AudioStarted flag to 1 if sound is enabled (field 0x424 != 0)\n  3. Update timing accumulators on SmackBuffer at offset [0x428 + FrameNum*4]:\n     - Add TimePerFrame (0x1c) to TimeAccumLow (0x20) and TimeAccumHigh (0x28)\n     - If TimeAccumLow > 0xFA00000 (262 million) and TimeAccumHigh > 0x2000000 (33 million):\n       Wrap by subtracting 0xFA00000 and adding 0x3E800 (256000) to TimeElapsed (0x24)\n  4. Get active audio tracks bitmask from Smack+0x390\n  5. For each active track (via FindFirstSetBit):\n     a. Get track data pointer from Smack+0x3E8+track*4\n     b. Calculate data size: if compressed (flag 0x80000000), use [data+4]; else use [data]-4\n     c. Set \"no data\" flag in SmackBuffer+0x4c based on data size == 0\n     d. Call progress callback if registered (g_dwProgressCallbackCount != 0)\n     e. Clamp data size to available buffer space (SmackBuffer[6] - SmackBuffer[4])\n     f. Handle buffer wrap: fill silence (0x00 or 0x80 for unsigned) if lookahead enabled\n     g. Copy track data to circular buffer (or decompress via FUN_10011f10 if compressed)\n     h. Update buffer position pointers and wrap if needed\n  6. After all tracks processed, check timing overflow and reset accumulators if needed\n\nParameters:\n  pSmack (Smack*) - Pointer to the Smack video structure containing frame and audio data\n\nReturns:\n  void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Early exit if FrameNum == -1 (no active playback)\n  - Early exit if paused (field 0x44c != 0)\n  - Handles circular buffer wrap-around for audio data\n  - Fills silence bytes (0x00 for signed, 0x80 for unsigned audio) when lookahead is enabled\n  - Compressed audio (flag 0x80000000) uses FUN_10011f10 for decompression\n\nSmackBuffer Layout (accessed via puVar3):\n  Offset | Size | Field          | Description\n  -------|------|----------------|----------------------------------\n  0x00   | 4    | pBufferStart   | Start of circular buffer\n  0x04   | 4    | pBufferEnd     | End of circular buffer  \n  0x0C   | 4    | pWritePos      | Current write position\n  0x10   | 4    | dwBytesWritten | Total bytes written to buffer\n  0x18   | 4    | dwBufferSize   | Total buffer size in bytes\n  0x24   | 4    | dwSilenceBytes | Bytes of silence written\n  0x2C   | 4    | dwTotalBytes   | Running total of all bytes processed\n  0x30   | 4    | dwOverflowCnt  | Buffer overflow counter\n  0x34   | 4    | dwPadCount     | Silence padding counter\n  0x38   | 4    | dwLookahead    | Lookahead bytes threshold\n  0x4C   | 4    | bNoData        | Flag: no data available for track\n  0x50   | 4    | bIsUnsigned    | Flag: audio is unsigned (silence=0x80)\n  0x58   | 4    | bPadEnabled    | Silence padding enabled\n  0x5C   | 4    | bPadActive     | Silence padding currently active",
