      "signature": "void FUN_10006a90(short * pDestBuffer, short nScaleX, dword dwScaleFactors, short nOffsetY, short nOffsetX, short nShearY)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Transform and write vertex coordinate data to output buffer\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Load pDestBuffer pointer and extract address + 2 (start of array elements)\n  2. Write nScaleX value to array[0] via immediate MOV\n  3. Calculate dwScaleFactors >> 0x2 (right shift by 2 bits), write to array[1]\n  4. Compute array[2] = nOffsetY * nScaleX - 4 * nShearY (sheared offset)\n  5. Compute array[3] = nOffsetY * nScaleX (unsheared offset for comparison)\n  6. Calculate EBP = nShearY * 0x4 (scale shear factor)\n  7. Compute array[4] = nOffsetX * nScaleX - dwScaleFactors * nShearY (cross-term)\n\nParameters:\n  pDestBuffer     Pointer to short array, minimum 5 elements (indices 0-4)\n  nScaleX         Scale factor for primary dimension (short, typically positive)\n  dwScaleFactors  Combined scaling value (0-bit shift amount encoded in bits)\n  nOffsetY        Y-axis offset (short signed value)\n  nOffsetX        X-axis offset (short signed value)\n  nShearY         Shear/skew parameter (short, multiplied by -4)\n\nReturns:\n  void - Array elements [0] through [4] populated with transformation data",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "MNE",
