      "name": "CopyBitmapRegion",
      "signature": "void CopyBitmapRegion(uint16 * pDestBuffer, int nDestPitch, uint16 * pSrcBuffer, int nSrcPitch, uint dwWidth, int nHeight)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Copies a rectangular region of bitmap data row-by-row with pitch handling.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Outer loop iterates nHeight times\n  2. Calculate word count: dwWidth >> 1 (divide by 2)\n  3. If word count non-zero, use REP MOVSW to copy 16-bit words\n  4. Extract odd byte flag: dwWidth ",
