      "comment": "Returns the size of Smack buffer overhead in bytes.\n\nAlgorithm:\n  1. Returns constant 0xd068 (53,352) - size of Smack structure header and internal buffers\n\nReturns:\n  uint - Overhead size in bytes for Smack buffer allocations (0xd068 / 53,352 bytes)\n\nSpecial Cases:\n  - Always returns the same constant value\n  - No parameters, no state, no error conditions\n  - Used by SmackOpen to calculate total buffer requirements",
